    description: Some("An unreleased Atari game starring Bugs Bunny: dodge Elmer Fudd\'s shotgun and dive into the hole a hound leaves after digging up each carrot, before Elmer draws a bead on you. Swipe the bullets from under Elmer\'s house to disable him and grab the glowing bonus carrots — but he only gets faster and quicker on the trigger."),
